Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 15:47:51 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] feat(chrome): account menu on the title bar avatar

Name, e-mail and server, Connect Nextcloud / Murena or Disconnect, Change name (run on the host start page, which owns the session) and the test-user switcher in developer mode. Strings in en, fr, de, es, it, pt, pt-pt, nl, ru, pl, ja, zh for the three editors.

Assisted-by: ClaudeCode:claude-opus-5-5
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
